        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>A friend of mine had a question about the Living Weapon title card, so we wanted some clarification on this. It states that you get the title if you destroy a target using your innate power (I don&#39;t have the exact wording on me at the time). I feel like the implication here is that it is only availagble to heroes with innate powers that deal damage (Ra, Chrono Ranger, Guise, etc...). However, he was able to play a card using Prime Warden&#39;s Haka that destroyed a target. Would he have gotten the Living Weapon Title since he did USE his innate power to destroy the target? (We played continued to play it that your power needs to deal damage, but I would like confirmation on it.)</p>",
